  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_c4372955-c8ad-4b7f-b5a6-7696cca9bfad.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/commits-since/Gilded-Games/The-Aether/1.14.4-0.0.1?color=22272E&label=commits&logo=github&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&label=issues&logo=github&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-pr-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&label=pull requests&logo=github&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&type=pledges&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/crowdin-aether-blue?color=55BC5C&label=crowdin&logo=crowdin&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&logoSource=feather&style=flat-square&color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsparkuniverse.com%252fget%252faether-legends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/refs/heads/main/images/legends.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"7680\" height=\"2160\"></a></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 关于天空之境 ☁️<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p>天空之境团队为您带来原版天空之境模组！该模组已针对现代版本的 Minecraft 进行持续维护与更新，并完全支持多人联机游戏！</p>\n<p>天空之境以高悬于天际的维度为核心，充满了由云层构成的<strong>广阔空岛</strong>与<strong>浮空岛屿</strong>。该维度拥有全新的生存冒险体验，围绕基础且贴近原版的<strong>生存进度</strong>展开，包含<strong>新矿石</strong>、<strong>神话生物</strong>以及<strong>三座险峻的地牢</strong>，每座地牢都藏有<strong>强力的战利品</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 模组内容一览 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>天空之境模组包含众多可交互的新特性，其中大部分已在<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1275355-1-7-3-aether-collaboration-mod-v1-02-new-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">天空之境协作模组</a>的原始论坛帖子中进行了说明。以下是该内容的简要概述：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>天空中的敌意天堂：天空之境维度！请注意不要掉下去，否则你会回到主世界。</li>\n<li>大量可从该维度直接获取的新方块与物品。</li>\n<li>3种实用方块：祭坛、冷冻器和孵化器。</li>\n<li>4种材料等级：天根木、圣银、赞尼特和重力金属，每种材料都有专属的工具与武器，并具备独特能力。</li>\n<li>《知识之书》，收录了模组内所有方块与物品的详细条目。</li>\n<li>饰品系统，配备独特的图形界面，可让你充分利用探索到的战利品。</li>\n<li>既让人联想到主世界生物，又专为天空之境设计的独特生物。</li>\n<li>莫亚鸟：一种可骑乘的飞行生物，分为不同等级，跳跃次数各不相同。</li>\n<li>3座待征服的新建筑：青铜、白银与黄金地牢，每座都藏有待拾取的装备与待击败的首领。</li>\n<li>永恒白昼：仅在最终地牢被征服后方可结束，之后可通过独特的实用方块“太阳祭坛”来控制昼夜循环。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_b9ff2a53-d0c1-4bb9-b5a1-fe05b6e238ec.png\"></a></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"></pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 入门指南 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>要开始探索天空之境，你必须用<strong>发光石材</strong>搭建传送门框架，并在中间倒上一桶<strong>水</strong>进行激活。这将启动传送门，让你步入其中进入该维度。从这里开始，你便能在天空之境的敌意天堂中开启生存之旅！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"387\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 攻略地牢 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>天空之境的地图中包含三座全新的神秘地牢，每座都有一名令人畏惧的首领等待你去击败……</p>\n<p><strong>青铜地牢</strong>是哨兵的家园，由神秘的<strong>滑行者</strong>镇守，这是一种由纯粹岩石诞生的生物。留意穿过岛屿的隐藏隧道，并用你能打造的最强装备做好充分准备！</p>\n<p><strong>白银地牢</strong>是美丽的瓦尔基里神殿。挑战瓦尔基里骑士团的骑士们，若你证明了自己，将与<strong>瓦尔基里女王</strong>亲自对决。请善用一切工具与技巧，战胜这位古老的战士。</p>\n<p>在稀有的<strong>黄金地牢</strong>深处，沉睡着<strong>太阳神</strong>——一位由纯粹火焰与能量构成的永恒存在。他是统治太阳本身的神明，甚至愿意关注你这样的渺小存在都需要极大的说服力。但传闻他守护着天空之境中最顶尖的宝藏之一。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"356\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 加入社区交流 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>欢迎加入我们的 Discord 服务器，与超过一万名不断增长的社区成员畅聊！</p>\n<p>对开发者有疑问？需要帮助配置模组？发现了漏洞？我们为天空之境模组设有专门的支持与开发频道！或者你只是想聊聊模组，或在官方服务器组织游戏活动？天空之境的 Discord 就是最佳去处！我们友好的工作人员和热情的社区将确保你在这里宾至如家。<a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 支持天空之境团队 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>没有你们的支持，天空之境的开发就不可能实现。请考虑通过赞助来帮助我们资助开发工作！每一笔赞助都将直接用于项目开发，使我们能够继续做我们最热爱的事情。<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 为项目贡献力量 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>想要为天空之境模组贡献力量吗？天空之境采用开源模式，意味着任何感兴趣的人都可以提交代码来帮助项目发展！更多详情请查看我们的 <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#wrench-contribute-to-the-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。</p>\n<p>我们还通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 接受项目的翻译贡献，让天空之境能够惠及更多玩家！</p>\n<p>我们的 <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#speech_balloon-translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">翻译</a> 与代码 <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/CREDITS.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献者</a> 名单均可在 GitHub 仓库中找到。</p>",
